{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "022nat_402_2_4_022_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f9a7e075cd302cdc767a4511b2aaee84702b6b6d5012c80b74eb1d6b91b8dc31",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:022nat_402_2_4_022_02_09_a:2_4_022_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02cb878c94099b306f6997bae7f03f37a0ebb19edbb8629210dfa3a206f916ad",
      "text": "辛苦了，●●●●プロデューサー。\n活动……很开心，呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:022nat_402_2_4_022_02_09_a:2_4_022_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c3c6fd76d70a33d1bb8774b3f5b5ce131911c9152745fc923c257f2789f6611",
      "text": "因为有你听我商量……我想我应该做到了\n想出各种办法……来做引导。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:022nat_402_2_4_022_02_09_a:2_4_022_02_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6067a845d610069920b1e28ed7bf022162d313c6e25902a52c9b65b0d49da1a5",
      "text": "自由活动的时候……我和妹妹常玩的拍手游戏……\n试着玩了一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:022nat_402_2_4_022_02_09_a:2_4_022_02_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbffbcae2c72db4dcb8a15f832c815ae86a221a62401e2751759d77349e4764d",
      "text": "中途翼先生也一起……加入了。\n大家……都玩得好起劲。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:022nat_402_2_4_022_02_09_a:2_4_022_02_09_a:cmd-000014:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:743c91d65c11a858c5f3545e94a415752598f1bb5713b88dc2b038405f1c4993",
      "text": "在小孩子们中间\n大受欢迎呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:022nat_402_2_4_022_02_09_a:2_4_022_02_09_a:cmd-000015:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a3df8ace61df031c807517380de82500a774d32624d347070895027cbf5a41c",
      "text": "我觉得夏来先生的优点\n很好地展现出来了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:022nat_402_2_4_022_02_09_a:2_4_022_02_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52ce93159d09ba1295c81aa375deb5148533d1126cedbd57a8fc28a937468c1c",
      "text": "……要是那样的话，我很开心。大家跑来\n跟我说了好多话，稍微有点吓了一跳……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:022nat_402_2_4_022_02_09_a:2_4_022_02_09_a:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77b2186ca028de111418eb29c345d36d91b1a64a08853fa5af484c09428c22ae",
      "text": "是……这样吗？既然制作人\n都这么说了……那肯定就是这样吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:022nat_402_2_4_022_02_09_a:2_4_022_02_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ac02ef76e29de397fb9bae47831066b2ceaf4b8d6a01c0f6d7519fad58dbd2e",
      "text": "看着大家的笑脸……不知不觉就在想\n怎样才能让他们更开心呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:022nat_402_2_4_022_02_09_a:2_4_022_02_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a92a1a7846b780215c32ec59bebd0df6bb83bddf06bffd73a93753ea5f2a9f36",
      "text": "很自然地……思考了好多好多……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:022nat_402_2_4_022_02_09_a:2_4_022_02_09_a:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:229e5f2ce6f7d058dccbc9f3efc9e6e3c6ee8424a4e5d19f13f9db40aa3bff07",
      "text": "下次的工作里，我也想为了能让大家\n像这样开心……而继续努力……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:022nat_402_2_4_022_02_09_a:2_4_022_02_09_a:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b86ff5f75e27889f27d04968c1705eb63e4e389ff03463affab9f804995ec85",
      "text": "要是又有和平时不一样的、工作的话……还能找你……\n商量吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:022nat_402_2_4_022_02_09_a:2_4_022_02_09_a:cmd-000034:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c3e0eab7135bbf0124c363d162784a0708abfe045d94917138ffb36a58b21a3",
      "text": "当然可以！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:022nat_402_2_4_022_02_09_a:2_4_022_02_09_a:cmd-000037:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e43964dc321cc0a7bc45b8817ef9613cf439e4222528d5852e57368f0712dd5",
      "text": "……谢谢你。\n那么……再联络哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
